          <p class="card-text">Turns course syllabi into a calendar you can trust. Self-hosted with Docker and reads syllabus PDFs with Claude.</p>
          <p><span class="badge bg-secondary">TypeScript</span> <span class="badge bg-secondary">Docker</span></p>
          <a href="https://github.com/Dev-APkash/syllabus-sync" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i> View Code</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
      <div class="card h-100">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i> n8n Self-Healing Monitor</h5>
          <p class="card-text">An automated home lab sysadmin built with n8n, Docker and LLMs that watches services and fixes them.</p>
          <p><span class="badge bg-secondary">Shell</span> <span class="badge bg-secondary">n8n</span></p>
          <a href="https://github.com/Dev-APkash/n8n-self-healing-monitor" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i> View Code</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

