          <p class="card-text">A tiny self-hosted poster wall of everything you have watched on Jellyfin. No accounts, no trackers, about 5 MB.</p>
          <p><span class="badge bg-secondary">HTML</span> <span class="badge bg-secondary">Jellyfin</span></p>
          <a href="https://github.com/Dev-APkash/watched" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i> View Code</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
