          <p class="card-text">Configuration and notes for my self-hosted home lab setup.</p>
          <p><span class="badge bg-secondary">Docker</span> <span class="badge bg-secondary">Linux</span></p>
          <a href="https://github.com/Dev-APkash/Homelab-Infrastructure" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i> View Code</a>
